 Hard rules remain unchanged: no packet drops, no mutable packet sharing, no per-connection reorder, no chunk FIFO skip, no entity tick/AI/damage/interaction skip, no Bukkit off-thread mutation, no plugin event reorder and no redstone/factory phase reorder.
